    "Each note played as several slightly-detuned copies — the difference between one thin voice and an ensemble. 1 voice = off." : {
      "comment" : "Panel text (E4-7, 2026-09-30): SwiftUI literal keys of EchoelStudioView, the instrument — localised by content, no Sources change.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each note played as several slightly-detuned copies — the difference between one thin voice and an ensemble. 1 voice = off."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jede Note als mehrere leicht verstimmte Kopien gespielt — der Unterschied zwischen einer dünnen Stimme und einem Ensemble. 1 Stimme = aus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How each character speaks: 0 = slow swell (bowed strings, glass bowl) · 1 = struck / sharp onset (mallet, plucked, tuba stab). Sets touch response too; click-safe." : {
      "comment" : "Panel text (E4-7, 2026-09-30): SwiftUI literal keys of EchoelStudioView, the instrument — localised by content, no Sources change.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How each character speaks: 0 = slow swell (bowed strings, glass bowl) · 1 = struck / sharp onset (mallet, plucked, tuba stab). Sets touch response too; click-safe."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wie jeder Charakter anspricht: 0 = langsames Anschwellen (gestrichene Saiten, Glasschale) · 1 = angeschlagen / scharfer Einsatz (Mallet, gezupft, Tuba-Stab). Setzt auch die Touch-Reaktion; klick-sicher."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This sound's own loudness, so one instrument does not sit far above or below the others. 1.00 = unity. The built-in sounds arrive pre-matched; this trims from there." : {
      "comment" : "Panel text (E4-7, 2026-09-30): SwiftUI literal keys of EchoelStudioView, the instrument — localised by content, no Sources change.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This sound's own loudness, so one instrument does not sit far above or below the others. 1.00 = unity. The built-in sounds arrive pre-matched; this trims from there."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die eigene Lautheit dieses Klangs, damit ein Instrument nicht weit über oder unter den anderen sitzt. 1,00 = neutral. Die eingebauten Klänge kommen vorab angeglichen; das hier trimmt von dort aus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reinforces the bass an octave below — feel it on a sub, in headphones, or as haptics. Presence makes it read on small speakers (octaves only, always in key); heat saturates without getting louder." : {
      "comment" : "Panel text (E4-7, 2026-09-30): SwiftUI literal keys of EchoelStudioView, the instrument — localised by content, no Sources change.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reinforces the bass an octave below — feel it on a sub, in headphones, or as haptics. Presence makes it read on small speakers (octaves only, always in key); heat saturates without getting louder."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verstärkt den Bass eine Oktave tiefer — spür ihn auf einem Sub, im Kopfhörer oder als Haptik. Präsenz macht ihn auf kleinen Lautsprechern lesbar (nur Oktaven, immer in der Tonart); Hitze sättigt, ohne lauter zu werden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
