    "Tap a destination to route a source to it. Compatible types connect directly or via a converter (e.g. pitch→colour, bio→MIDI CC). Light and spatial follow the music live today; other edges are authored here as their adapters come online." : {
      "comment" : "Panel text (E4-8, 2026-09-30): SwiftUI literal keys of the Routing surface (PatchbayView) and the effects panel (EchoelFXView) — localised by content, no Sources change.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap a destination to route a source to it. Compatible types connect directly or via a converter (e.g. pitch→colour, bio→MIDI CC). Light and spatial follow the music live today; other edges are authored here as their adapters come online."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tippe ein Ziel an, um eine Quelle darauf zu routen. Kompatible Typen verbinden sich direkt oder über einen Wandler (z. B. Tonhöhe→Farbe, Bio→MIDI-CC). Licht und Raum folgen der Musik heute live; andere Kanten werden hier angelegt, sobald ihre Adapter da sind."
          }
        }
      }
    },
