    "DMX resolution — 16-bit for smooth fades, 8-bit for legacy fixtures" : {
      "comment" : "Panel text (E4-8, 2026-09-30): SwiftUI literal keys of the Routing surface (PatchbayView) and the effects panel (EchoelFXView) — localised by content, no Sources change.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DMX resolution — 16-bit for smooth fades, 8-bit for legacy fixtures"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DMX-Auflösung — 16 Bit für weiche Fades, 8 Bit für ältere Geräte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Master scales the brightness of all outgoing light data (Art-Net + sACN). Blackout goes dark instantly; the return fades back in flicker-free. 16-bit sends paired coarse/fine channels for smooth fades; pick 8-bit only for fixtures that cannot read them." : {
      "comment" : "Panel text (E4-8, 2026-09-30): SwiftUI literal keys of the Routing surface (PatchbayView) and the effects panel (EchoelFXView) — localised by content, no Sources change.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Master scales the brightness of all outgoing light data (Art-Net + sACN). Blackout goes dark instantly; the return fades back in flicker-free. 16-bit sends paired coarse/fine channels for smooth fades; pick 8-bit only for fixtures that cannot read them."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Master skaliert die Helligkeit aller ausgehenden Lichtdaten (Art-Net + sACN). Blackout wird sofort dunkel; die Rückkehr blendet flimmerfrei wieder ein. 16 Bit sendet Grob/Fein-Kanalpaare für weiche Fades; 8 Bit nur für Geräte wählen, die sie nicht lesen können."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fixtures repeats the same colour across that many lamps from address 1 — addressing the rig, not moving light through it: every lamp shows the SAME colour, because this output produces one. Spacing is the gap between their start addresses; 0 means back to back. This matters most on sACN, which by specification fills all 512 slots — so with one fixture addressed, every other lamp on that universe is driven dark." : {
      "comment" : "Panel text (E4-8, 2026-09-30): SwiftUI literal keys of the Routing surface (PatchbayView) and the effects panel (EchoelFXView) — localised by content, no Sources change.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fixtures repeats the same colour across that many lamps from address 1 — addressing the rig, not moving light through it: every lamp shows the SAME colour, because this output produces one. Spacing is the gap between their start addresses; 0 means back to back. This matters most on sACN, which by specification fills all 512 slots — so with one fixture addressed, every other lamp on that universe is driven dark."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Geräte wiederholt dieselbe Farbe über so viele Lampen ab Adresse 1 — es adressiert das Rig, es bewegt kein Licht hindurch: jede Lampe zeigt DIESELBE Farbe, weil dieser Ausgang eine erzeugt. Abstand ist die Lücke zwischen ihren Startadressen; 0 heißt direkt hintereinander. Das zählt vor allem bei sACN, das laut Spezifikation alle 512 Slots füllt — mit einem adressierten Gerät wird jede andere Lampe in diesem Universum dunkel gefahren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
